s and the enemy tower itself.\n\nA NEW MISSION EVERY TIME\nLevels rebuild themselves every run, the middle stages shuffle their order, and even the bosses change their moves. No two missions are ever the same.\n\nGIANT BOSSES\nThe Iron Croc. The Drill Fiend. The Warhawk. The Girder Golem. And waiting at the very top — General Vox.\n\nJUNGLE ACTION\nSwing on ropes over shark-infested water, dodge rolling robot bombs, outsmart tripod guns, and clear every ambush to advance.\n\nMADE FOR EVERYONE\nNo ads. No in-app purchases. No internet needed. No data collected. Just honest arcade fun — with an attract demo mode, just like the arcade machines of the 80s.\n\nThe first mission in the AGENT NICK series.\nA PLAYTIME game — Classic games. Big imaginations.", "contentAdvisoryRating": "9+", "trackCensoredName": "Agent Nick: Secret Mission", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/agent-nick-secret-mission/id6787749069?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 0, "genreIds": ["6014", "7002", "7001"], "releaseDate": "2026-07-09T07:00:00Z", "bundleId": "com.playtime.agentnick", "userRatingCount": 0}]}